[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈、第三審査の結果が出たぞ\r\n突破だ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "014",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "006"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001050010,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えっホントに？\r\nやった～っ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400105/7014001050010"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001050020,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "どうしよどうしよ\r\nめっちゃテンション上がっちゃってる！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400105/7014001050020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ここ最近\r\n今まで以上にがんばっていたよな",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈のがんばりは、目を見張るものがあった",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だからその分、\r\n今回の結果を聞いた喜びも大きいんだと思う",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001050030,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……そっか、輝きたいって思ってるもんね、\r\n今の甘奈は",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400105/7014001050030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001050040,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "本気でがんばろうって思ったから、\r\nこの気持ちに気づけたんだよ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400105/7014001050040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "良かったな、甘奈",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001050050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん、ホントに良かった！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400105/7014001050050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001050060,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あ、あとね、プロデューサーさん\r\n甘奈、もう１つ気づいたことがあるんだ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400105/7014001050060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　なんだ？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001050070,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甘奈が輝けるのは\r\n応援してくれるファンのみんながいるからってこと！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400105/7014001050070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ、そうだな\r\nファンあってこそのアイドルだ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ファンもこれからどんどん輝いていく甘奈に、\r\nきっと期待しているぞ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001050080,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへ、そうかも！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400105/7014001050080"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001050090,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "『W.I.N.G.』に出て、ファンのみんなの期待に応えたいな\r\n輝いてる甘奈を見てもらいたい！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400105/7014001050090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なら、何が何でも『W.I.N.G.』に出場しないとな！",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001050100,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん『W.I.N.G.』を目指して\r\n甜花ちゃんと輝いていけるんだもんね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400105/7014001050100"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]